<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένταθλ-ον</span></b> , Lyr. and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεντάεθλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contest of the
				five exercises</i> (viz. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμα,
				ποδωκείην, δίσκον, ἄκοντα, πάλην</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				153
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				7.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				8.104
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεντάεθλον
			ἐπασκέειν</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.92
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				9.33
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένταθλ᾽ ἃ νομίζεται</span>
			is corrupt in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				691
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμπαθλον</span>.</div>
